@verbs north south east west directions moving
@tier player
@title walking from one place to another

To move you type the direction, nothing else:

  north  south  east  west
  northeast  northwest  southeast  southwest
  up  down  inside  outside  stairs

The initials are enough: n, s, e, w, ne, nw, se, sw, and 'in' and
'out' for inside and outside.

Only the exits that place has will work. The ones there are get
listed in brackets beside the name of the place, like this:

  The village gate [e,n,s,w].

A direction that is not there answers that it did not work. And an
exit may have a door, in which case it has to be opened first.
